  "details": "When the lens is in pickup range, the camera's UI laser is completely suppressed. This means you have to move your hands quite far from the lens before adjusting any settings. It would be nice if this pickup was less sensitive - perhaps taking into account whether you are pointing at the lens or not - or otherwise allowed the camera UI to take priority at appropriate times.",
